(version 1)
# Nosh: JLCPCB design rules, taken unchanged from kicad-druid (MIT licence, notice below).
#   Source: https://github.com/Cimos/kicad-druid  file JLCPCB/JLCPCB-6L-1oz.kicad_dru
#   Upstream commit: 8af046d6a1839320a360a4b6790ac11eb27a78ae (2026-09-03)
#   The 4-layer 1 oz file (JLCPCB/JLCPCB.kicad_dru) has identical rules; only its header differs.
#   KiCad loads <project>.kicad_dru automatically. After changing it, open Board Setup >
#   Design Rules > Custom Rules and check for errors: kicad-cli DRC silently ignores a broken file.
